<title>PORTUGAL: Avge yld 5.497 pct on Portugal 3-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Avge yld 5.497 pct on Portugal 3-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the result of the Portuguese Institute for Public Credit Management auction of three-year fixed-rate bonds (OT).</p>
<p>ISSUER: Republic of Portugal   MATURITY:23/3/2000</p>
<p>AMOUNT OFFERED: 25 billion escudos</p>
<p>AMOUNT PLACED: 25 billion escudos COUPON: 5.375 pct</p>
<p>AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 5.49724</p>
<p>HIGHEST ACCEPTED: 5.50  LOWEST: 5.40</p>
<p>BIDS: 62.10 billion  PAYMENT FREQUENCY:Annual</p>
<p>NOTES: The issue is fungible. The auction takes to 108.6 billion escudos the total amount of the bonds issued.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
